Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.15,0:00:06.30,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Your engagement to Lady Maria \Nwill be officially announced shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.30,0:00:09.87,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,I've prepared a plan for going forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.62,0:00:16.80,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Is there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.80,0:00:17.81,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.71,0:00:26.67,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,You called, Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.67,0:00:29.98,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Yes, Placido. Thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.98,0:00:31.52,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,It's no problem at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.52,0:00:34.14,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,You're far busier than I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.22,0:00:38.06,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,What are your plans for the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.76,0:00:40.77,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,My plans?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.34,0:00:42.52,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.52,0:00:48.05,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Well, this week I'm attending \Nan equestrian meet as an advisor,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.05,0:00:50.49,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,and I have a student council \Nmeeting at the academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.49,0:00:51.54,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Also...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.54,0:00:56.17,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,No, I mean when are you getting \Nengaged to Lady Aida Ametis?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.07,0:01:07.29,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,My name is Mimi. I'm currently studying \Nabroad in the Kingdom of Rubini.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.29,0:01:11.54,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,My dad told me to find \Nmyself a good husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.42,0:01:12.43,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H592A4E&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\bord1.5\blur1\fs25}NO WAY
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.54,0:01:14.80,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,Honestly, I didn't think it was possible,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.80,0:01:19.43,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,but I ended up dating \NCrown Prince Renato,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.43,0:01:22.03,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,and now I couldn't be happier!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.73,0:01:27.85,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You could say I'm having \Nthe greatest time of my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.85,0:01:30.61,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Mimi, watch your step.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.87,0:01:36.97,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.79,0:01:43.90,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,That's right. I shouldn't be celebrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.54,0:01:48.27,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,Aida hasn't been proposed to yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.80,0:01:53.80,sign_Georgia,EPTITLE,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,65)\c&H141722&\bord4\shad0\fs27\3c&HF4F3FC&}Episode 9
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.80,0:01:53.80,sign_Georgia,EPTITLE,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(319,260)\fs22\c&H080600&\bord0\shad0}The {\c&H8A73F3&}One {\c&H20222A&}Who Got Away Plays {\c&HD19F5B&}Cupid
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.57,0:01:57.56,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,What do you intend to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.17,0:02:00.18,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Let's not talk about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.86,0:02:04.35,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,How can you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.98,0:02:08.86,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Placido, I know you're \Nin love with Lady Aida.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.86,0:02:09.86,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.86,0:02:16.49,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,And Duke Ametis would be delighted if his \Ndaughter got engaged to the second prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.49,0:02:18.95,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.95,0:02:21.76,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,But what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.76,0:02:23.91,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Is there something you \Ndon't like about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.91,0:02:25.21,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.21,0:02:26.84,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Then why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.84,0:02:29.57,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Lady Aida is gentle and bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.57,0:02:31.60,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,What more could you ask for?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.10,0:02:35.84,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Yes, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.52,0:02:43.60,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,I know Prince Placido is \Na sincere and wonderful man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.60,0:02:45.08,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Then why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.08,0:02:49.06,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,It's your turn. I want you to be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.28,0:02:56.53,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Do you not like him anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.53,0:02:57.60,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.03,0:03:00.68,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,I love him very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.15,0:03:09.70,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,That's why I mustn't get in his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.70,0:03:12.42,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.36,0:03:17.08,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Because I'm a wanton woman trying \Nto marry Prince Renato's brother
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.08,0:03:22.56,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,the moment he called off our engagement.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.56,0:03:27.39,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Wait. You didn't call off \Nthe engagement, he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.59,0:03:31.36,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I told her not to worry
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.36,0:03:35.15,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,and that I'd knock out anyone \Nwho says nasty things about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.15,0:03:37.27,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Placido is the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.27,0:03:43.45,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,They say they want each other \Nto be happy while pulling away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.86,0:03:46.78,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,It's so frustrating. \NI can't take it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.78,0:03:51.88,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I've thought about it, and \NI think I understand how they feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.88,0:03:56.38,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What? You're okay with \Nthem not being happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.38,0:03:58.40,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Lady Aida is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.40,0:04:02.52,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,For better or for worse, people pay \Nattention to the royals' behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.52,0:04:08.05,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Neither can bear the other being \Nbad-mouthed because of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.05,0:04:11.01,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,In reality, Lady Aida became ill
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.01,0:04:15.73,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,when she was first \Nconsidered for crown princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.25,0:04:18.59,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.59,0:04:21.42,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,When I was 12, Dad told me \Na distant relative
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.42,0:04:26.20,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,would be coming from Rubini \Nto recuperate with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.96,0:04:31.18,flashback,IDEA,0,0,0,,That girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.18,0:04:33.79,flashback,MIMI,0,0,0,,That must be Lady Aida.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.75,0:04:39.01,flashback,MIMI,0,0,0,,Lady Aida, I am Maria, fifth \Ndaughter of Count Annovazzi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.01,0:04:41.95,flashback,MIMI,0,0,0,,My specialty is Number 38.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.63,0:04:45.31,flashback,MIMI,0,0,0,,You're so pretty, Lady Aida.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.31,0:04:47.93,flashback,MIMI,0,0,0,,You look just like the princess \NI saw in a picture book.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.93,0:04:49.10,flashback,IDEA,0,0,0,,Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.10,0:04:51.40,flashback,SANDA,0,0,0,,You're scaring Lady Aida.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.40,0:04:54.27,flashback,IDEA,0,0,0,,She's here to rest her mind and body.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.27,0:04:56.03,flashback,IDEA,0,0,0,,Don't intimidate her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.41,0:04:59.37,flashback,MIMI,0,0,0,,Are you ill? What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.37,0:05:00.28,flashback,IDEA & SANDRA,0,0,0,,Mimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.06,0:05:04.95,flashback,AIDA,0,0,0,,I haven't been sleeping well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.95,0:05:06.48,flashback,MIMI,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.48,0:05:10.21,flashback,MIMI,0,0,0,,There isn't a girl who sleeps more \Nsoundly than me after practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.41,0:05:13.03,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,A girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.71,0:05:19.05,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,So Lady Aida thought you were a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.05,0:05:24.03,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Exactly. Perhaps it's because \NI still wore my hair short back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.03,0:05:26.03,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.03,0:05:28.79,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,But we became friends right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.79,0:05:29.73,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I'm sure you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.73,0:05:35.40,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,We went on long rides together, \Ncooked together, studied together,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.40,0:05:39.69,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,stayed up all night talking together, \Nand got in trouble together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.69,0:05:43.45,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I was so sad when Aida left.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.71,0:05:51.43,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,To me, Aida is a precious friend \Nwho supported me while studying abroad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.43,0:05:55.12,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,She taught me how to act like a lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.12,0:05:57.96,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I really want her to be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.39,0:06:03.97,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,So do I, but what should \Nwe actually do about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.97,0:06:08.72,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I invited them to today's dinner party, \Nbut neither of them came.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.19,0:06:12.05,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I think they're avoiding each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.95,0:06:18.91,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Mimi, why are you in such a hurry?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.91,0:06:20.51,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,I'm out of breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.92,0:06:25.41,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I forgot to do my homework. \NCould you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.32,0:06:30.70,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I'll go get a pen and notebook.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.18,0:06:39.34,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Is someone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.42,0:06:45.43,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,It's me, Placido.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.11,0:06:47.54,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.54,0:06:51.13,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Raimondo asked me \Nto organize the library.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.13,0:06:53.44,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Where is Lord Raimondo?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.06,0:06:56.19,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,He said something came up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.43,0:07:02.38,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I can't hear anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.38,0:07:05.32,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,I can't find volume four \Nof this plant encyclopedia.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.32,0:07:08.54,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,I think that was on the other shelf.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.54,0:07:09.68,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.11,0:07:13.46,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Why are they organizing books?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.46,0:07:16.09,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Mimi, you're there, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.50,0:07:18.79,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Will you help us, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.95,0:07:26.38,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I didn't think they'd notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.89,0:07:32.11,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Well, that's unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.11,0:07:36.09,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,It sounds like Lady Aida had you beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.09,0:07:40.56,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I'm stumped. I guess \Nwe can't be indirect.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.56,0:07:42.07,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Indirect?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.07,0:07:46.02,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,If setting up the perfect \Nsituation doesn't work,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.02,0:07:48.57,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,we'll have to call in help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.02,0:07:51.03,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Help? From who?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.03,0:07:53.57,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,The queen, for example.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.27,0:07:58.79,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Even they'd obey an order from the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.15,0:08:01.75,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Mimi, we can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.75,0:08:03.25,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.03,0:08:05.96,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Because we'd be forcing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.42,0:08:10.42,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Listening to the words of \Na concerned mother is one thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.42,0:08:13.36,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,but obeying the commands \Nof a queen is no trivial matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.36,0:08:16.10,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,They would probably obey her,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.94,0:08:22.77,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,but would forcing them to face \Neach other make them happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.54,0:08:28.63,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,His Highness is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.63,0:08:32.41,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,I was only thinking about \Ngetting them together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.76,0:08:36.95,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,Ultimately, I was \Nignoring their feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.95,0:08:42.33,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I know you care deeply for them, \Nbut what's important is—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.33,0:08:44.66,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,It's not a decision \Nthey can be told to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.66,0:08:46.94,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,They have to decide for themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.01,0:08:53.51,sign_Verdana,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(430,20)\c&H405CF2&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0}BONK BONK BONK
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.01,0:08:50.82,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm so stupid, stupid, stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.82,0:08:54.03,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I wish I could knock \Nmyself out with Number 38.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.51,0:09:00.05,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Why not try talking to Lady Aida again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.05,0:09:04.12,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,If she's unsure, you can \Ngive her the push she needs,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.12,0:09:07.86,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,and if her decision is firm, \Nall you can do is watch over her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.83,0:09:11.12,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,That's what I'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.74,0:09:16.49,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,This is the chef's special cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.98,0:09:19.96,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Take it to Lady Aida.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.82,0:09:22.87,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Thank you, Lord Raimondo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.38,0:09:25.84,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.18,0:09:29.74,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,I hope it can be a conversation starter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.04,0:09:36.05,sign_Georgia,,0,0,0,,{\c&H141824&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\bord3\an1\frz11.98\pos(367,247)}Always a {\c&H8873F3&}Catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.56,0:09:40.79,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Aida, can I come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.79,0:09:41.85,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Mimi?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.38,0:09:45.04,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Were you studying?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.04,0:09:46.41,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Just a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.75,0:09:50.36,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Hey, thanks for organizing the library.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.36,0:09:52.93,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,You came here just to say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.93,0:09:56.37,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,And to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.03,0:09:59.14,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,That's not necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.14,0:10:02.59,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,I know you did that for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.02,0:10:06.00,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Lord Raimondo gave me something sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.00,0:10:07.79,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,It's a chestnut cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.79,0:10:09.18,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Chestnut?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.07,0:10:12.11,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Shall we have some, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.20,0:10:18.76,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.76,0:10:21.52,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,It really tastes like chestnuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.52,0:10:22.77,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.43,0:10:27.60,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Do you not like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.60,0:10:31.24,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,No, I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.86,0:10:35.63,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,I was just reminded of the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.98,0:10:37.28,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,The past?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.15,0:10:41.04,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Would you like to hear it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.04,0:10:43.29,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,I'll only tell you this story once.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.55,0:10:46.17,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.17,0:10:50.68,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,I was six years old when \NI met Prince Placido.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.87,0:11:04.63,flashback,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.85,0:11:07.53,flashback,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.53,0:11:10.29,flashback,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Those chestnuts don't belong to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.90,0:11:15.20,flashback,AIDA,0,0,0,,Who are you? What makes you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.20,0:11:18.62,flashback,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Because I'm related \Nto the owners of the tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.62,0:11:19.94,flashback,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.94,0:11:24.12,flashback,AIDA,0,0,0,,Well, I'm related to the people \Nwho pay for this tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.06,0:11:28.40,flashback,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,And you want them all to yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.40,0:11:29.88,flashback,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,You're greedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.88,0:11:31.82,flashback,AIDA,0,0,0,,They're not just for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.82,0:11:34.80,flashback,AIDA,0,0,0,,And you're bossy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.80,0:11:37.05,flashback,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,I'm not bossy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.05,0:11:41.69,flashback,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,If I'm bossy, then you're \Ngreedy and short-tempered.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.73,0:11:53.11,flashback,AIDA,0,0,0,,I don't like you. Go away, bossy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.70,0:11:54.92,flashbacktop,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.11,0:11:56.39,flashback,AIDA,0,0,0,,Here, bossy! You want chestnuts, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.39,0:11:58.28,flashback,AIDA,0,0,0,,Now go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.39,0:11:58.28,flashbacktop,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Stop that! Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.28,0:11:59.87,flashback,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.03,0:12:04.70,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,I got angry because I felt \Nlike he suddenly accused me
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.70,0:12:05.87,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,of stealing the chestnuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.87,0:12:11.84,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\pos(90,59)\c&H4B49F9&\3c&H2300D4&\shad0\bord1.5\fs15}BONK
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.87,0:12:11.84,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\c&H4B49F9&\3c&H2300D4&\shad0\bord1.5\pos(185,80)\fs15}BONK
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.87,0:12:09.23,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,That's a bit different from \Nthe story I heard before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.23,0:12:11.84,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I guess you used to be a tomboy, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.84,0:12:16.76,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,I was. I only seem ladylike now \Nbecause I studied so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.76,0:12:18.60,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.26,0:12:26.28,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,So, what did Prince Placido \Nsay when you next met
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.28,0:12:28.27,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,and he learned you're \Nthe duke's daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.02,0:12:31.06,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,He was surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.80,0:12:36.03,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,That was probably the first time \Nanyone had told him to go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.03,0:12:40.16,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Apparently. He told me about it \Nafter we became friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.31,0:12:49.27,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Duke Ametis told me you'll probably \Nbe chosen to be my brother's fiancée.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.06,0:12:51.04,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.38,0:12:54.29,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Congratulations, future queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.96,0:13:01.85,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Thank you, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.45,0:13:05.96,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I'm the one escorting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.31,0:13:09.40,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,My brother's been so busy recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.91,0:13:13.43,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,I hope I'm not inconveniencing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.43,0:13:14.82,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.70,0:13:19.82,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,We've been friends since \Nthe chestnut incident, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.46,0:13:24.99,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,The chestnut incident? \NYou don't have to call it that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.92,0:13:33.04,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,But ever since then, I knew \Nwe'd be friends for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.04,0:13:34.96,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,My hunch was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.12,0:13:44.47,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.60,0:13:52.61,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Aida, I believe I know better \Nthan anyone how kind you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.61,0:13:56.38,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You always put others first.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.38,0:14:02.36,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,But couldn't you put \Nyourself first for once?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.36,0:14:04.67,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.60,0:14:08.96,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Don't think about rumors, \Nyour family's expectations,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.96,0:14:11.96,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,or Prince Placido's feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.96,0:14:15.50,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Think only about what you want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.98,0:14:19.00,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,What I want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.00,0:14:22.28,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Yes. What do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.13,0:14:28.50,italics,AIDA/ID,0,0,0,,What do I want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.98,0:14:36.27,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Maybe I shouldn't have said \Nthose things to Aida yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.27,0:14:37.23,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.23,0:14:39.11,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Was I speaking out loud again?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.11,0:14:40.48,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Yes, clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.53,0:14:44.07,main,AIDA DAD,0,0,0,,Aida, good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.30,0:14:48.95,main,AIDA DAD,0,0,0,,Some sons of noblemen want to marry you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.80,0:14:52.33,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.64,0:14:55.96,main,AIDA DAD,0,0,0,,Their families are decent enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.96,0:15:00.04,main,AIDA DAD,0,0,0,,and they don't mind that your engagement \Nto Prince Renato was called off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.22,0:15:04.33,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Um, Duke Ametis...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.33,0:15:05.33,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.18,0:15:15.69,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Father, I appreciate \Nyou looking out for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.20,0:15:18.77,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,May I think on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.72,0:15:24.19,main,AIDA DAD,0,0,0,,Yes, of course. \NChoose your husband carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.20,0:15:27.44,main,MOB,0,0,0,,Did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.56,0:15:29.44,main,MOB,0,0,0,,Is it true?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.44,0:15:30.95,main,MOB,0,0,0,,It can't be, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.08,0:15:36.83,main,UMBERTO,0,0,0,,Duke Ametis is sure to \Nthrow in a dowry as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.83,0:15:38.64,main,MARCO,0,0,0,,This is a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.64,0:15:42.71,main,MARCO,0,0,0,,Lady Aida comes with a stain on her, \Nbut she's still a promising prospect.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.71,0:15:45.77,main,UMBERTO,0,0,0,,And she'll feel indebted \Nto anyone who's willing to marry her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.77,0:15:48.59,main,UMBERTO,0,0,0,,What a deal, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.19,0:15:53.72,main,MOB,0,0,0,,How do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.84,0:15:59.16,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,It's raining.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.39,0:16:05.11,main,GIRL A,0,0,0,,Is it true?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.11,0:16:08.66,main,GIRL B,0,0,0,,Yes, there's a duel. \NEveryone's talking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.22,0:16:12.74,main,GIRL C,0,0,0,,Terrible news, Lady Aida.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.74,0:16:13.85,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.39,0:16:24.84,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,I, Placido du Rubini, challenge you \Nto a duel for my honor and life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.19,0:16:29.97,main,GIRL C,0,0,0,,Prince Placido challenged someone \Nto a duel for insulting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.68,0:16:35.97,italics,AIDA/ID,0,0,0,,He mustn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.97,0:16:41.32,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Anyway, Duke Ametis found \Nnew fiancés for her this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.81,0:16:43.73,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Terrible news, Prince Renato.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.73,0:16:46.44,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What is it, Lord Raimondo?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.44,0:16:51.10,main,UMBERTO,0,0,0,,Wait, Your Highness. You must be joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.10,0:16:54.33,main,UMBERTO,0,0,0,,It's not as though I spoke poorly of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.33,0:16:57.62,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,A gentleman does not insult ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.62,0:17:00.49,main,GIRL D,0,0,0,,I've never seen Prince Placido \Nso angry before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.49,0:17:02.40,main,GIRL E,0,0,0,,Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.96,0:17:05.08,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.92,0:17:09.09,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Aida?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.47,0:17:14.93,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,I heard what happened, \Nbut my dignity is my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.93,0:17:17.81,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,I don't need you to defend it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.39,0:17:23.42,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Regrettably, I intended \Nto decline your offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.42,0:17:29.94,main,UMBERTO,0,0,0,,But if you don't get married, won't \Nit tarnish your family's reputation?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.94,0:17:33.82,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,This isn't enough \Nto shake the Ametis family.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.82,0:17:35.79,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Don't worry about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.37,0:17:38.75,main,UMBERTO,0,0,0,,B-But...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.75,0:17:41.77,main,MARCO,0,0,0,,Give it up. Don't say anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.74,0:17:49.59,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,I appreciate your offer, but \Nplease forgive me for declining.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.68,0:18:02.30,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,The rest of you, please \Nreturn to your classrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.30,0:18:18.52,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Your Highness, please sheath your sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.48,0:18:26.91,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,I'm pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.42,0:18:31.13,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,I thought I was defending you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.12,0:18:34.62,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,I'm never strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.52,0:18:42.12,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Your kindness has always encouraged me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.53,0:18:43.95,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Has it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.26,0:18:46.27,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,In that case,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.50,0:18:52.17,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,I will defend you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.84,0:19:01.12,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,You'll defend me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.12,0:19:07.57,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Yes. I've realized that what I want \Nto do is support and defend you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.17,0:19:10.61,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,You mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.20,0:19:16.97,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Yes. Please make me your wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.03,0:19:20.09,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Oh, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.97,0:19:25.35,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,If you're all right with that, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.68,0:19:27.62,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Of course I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.81,0:19:34.65,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Lady Aida Ametis,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.23,0:19:39.90,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,I swear to love you \Nuntil the end of my days.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.49,0:19:44.25,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Please be my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.56,0:19:47.66,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,I gladly accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.63,0:20:00.52,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I can't believe Aida said \Nshe wanted to defend him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.52,0:20:01.84,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.58,0:20:04.89,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You're not?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.89,0:20:08.61,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,You said you and Lady Aida are friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.38,0:20:12.15,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,You must have something in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.73,0:20:15.74,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I can finally report the news \Nto Father and Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.74,0:20:16.92,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.92,0:20:20.80,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,They've been waiting for this, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.31,0:20:29.79,main,KING,0,0,0,,Your engagement has our approval.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.79,0:20:31.17,main,QUEEN,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.02,0:20:34.97,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Thank you, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.53,0:20:38.68,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Thank you, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.68,0:20:42.03,main,KING,0,0,0,,I was getting impatient, Placido.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.03,0:20:42.89,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.39,0:20:48.12,main,KING,0,0,0,,I was considering \Nordering you to get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.54,0:20:50.81,main,QUEEN,0,0,0,,Honey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.69,0:20:52.93,main,KING,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.82,0:20:57.12,main,KING,0,0,0,,They remind me of when we were young.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.12,0:20:59.31,main,QUEEN,0,0,0,,Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.72,0:21:12.57,italics,AIDA/NA,0,0,0,,Mimi is always teaching me \Nthe importance of courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.35,0:21:15.67,flashback,MIMI,0,0,0,,Aida.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.58,0:21:18.08,flashback,MIMI,0,0,0,,How do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.25,0:21:21.97,flashback,AIDA,0,0,0,,Better than yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.97,0:21:25.51,flashback,MIMI,0,0,0,,I bet. Your color has returned, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.87,0:21:27.72,flashback,MIMI,0,0,0,,Shall we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.32,0:21:32.65,flashback,AIDA,0,0,0,,What? But I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.65,0:21:37.31,flashback,MIMI,0,0,0,,It's fine. Didn't you say \Nyou wanted to try it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.31,0:21:38.32,flashback,AIDA,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.32,0:21:41.99,flashback,MIMI,0,0,0,,I promise it'll be fun. Be brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.37,0:21:45.48,flashback,MIMI,0,0,0,,Try it. I'll be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.85,0:21:53.68,flashback,AIDA,0,0,0,,Thank you, Mimi.
