Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.93,0:23:29.76,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,Aida taught me about \Nthe language of flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.76,0:23:32.61,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,In the language of people, \NAida would mean lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.10,0:23:32.22,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an9\c&H54FFFB&\3c&H1E1E17&\4c&H4E48F2&\bord1.5\shad4}SQUEEZE!!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.61,0:23:34.55,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,Prince Placido would be pure.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.55,0:23:37.62,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,Prince Renato would be... handsome?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.62,0:23:39.98,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,Oh, no. I spoke my mind again.
